      "alt": "Create a deeply relaxing subliminal music track about [New Level].\n\nGenre: dreamy lo-fi, ambient chill, soft downtempo, relaxing sleep music, gentle rain atmosphere.\n\nThe music should feel warm, luxurious, safe, peaceful and emotionally uplifting.\n\nTempo: 65–75 BPM.\nVery soft drums, warm lo-fi textures, gentle piano, airy pads, subtle ambient sounds, soft rain texture, deep but gentle bass.\n\nCreate a beautiful hypnotic atmosphere suitable for relaxation, meditation, falling asleep, studying and walking.\n\nUnder the instrumental, include a separate whispered subliminal affirmation vocal layer.\n\nThe affirmation layer must contain at least 10 seconds of continuous spoken positive affirmations related specifically to [New Level].\n\nUse present tense.\nUse only positive formulations.\nDo not use negative words or negations.\nNo words such as “not”, “don't”, “never”, “without”.\n\nAffirmations should be short, emotionally positive, natural and repetitive.\n\nThe whispered voice must be deeply embedded under the instrumental, extremely subtle and difficult to consciously understand, while remaining present in the audio mix.\n\nThe instrumental must remain the main audible element.\n\nThe overall result should feel like beautiful relaxing music first and a subliminal experience second.\n\nNo obvious spoken narration.\nNo prominent vocals.\nNo dramatic transitions.\nNo aggressive drums.\nNo dark or anxious atmosphere.\n\nLength: 3–5 minutes.\nSeamless hypnotic flow.",
